Z||000000||JSocha||11-23-2001||01:22 AM||||<UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Talk about a huge breast! <BR><LI>Tying the legs together keeps the inside moist. <BR><LI>It's Cool Whip time! <BR><LI>If I don't undo my pants, I'll burst! <BR><LI>Whew, that's one terrific spread! <BR><LI>I'm in the mood for a litlle dark meat. <BR><LI>Are you ready for seconds? <BR><LI>It's a little dry, do you still want some? <BR><LI>Just wait your turn, you'll get some! <BR><LI>Don't play with your meat. <BR><LI>Just spread the legs open and stuff it in. <BR><LI>Do you think you'll be able to handle all these people at once? <BR><LI>I didn't expect everyone to come at once! <BR><LI>You still have a little bit on your chin. <BR><LI>How long will it take after you stick it in? <BR><LI>You'll know it's ready when it pops up. <BR><LI>Wow, I didn't think I could handle all of that! <BR><LI>That's the biggest one I've ever seen! <BR><LI>How long do I beat it before it's ready?<BR></UL><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
